      "alt": "登顶上海中心 · 赛事官方"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 6px 0 15px; padding: 8px 11px; line-height: 1.65; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.3px; color: #2f855a; background: #f4f8fb; border-left: 3px solid #d4a669; font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', 'PingFang SC', serif; font-style: italic;\">魔都里的人间</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">上周和同济的学弟ZOOM，半夜做梦竟回到了那段特别的上海时光，在梦里被灌的很惨，还喝了不少酒，<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"1\" style=\"color:#237953;font-weight:800;background:transparent;padding:0;border-bottom:3px solid #237953;padding-bottom:2px;\">导致第二天都有点晕</strong>。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">也算是在魔都留下过痕迹的人，上海算是我的<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"2\" style=\"color:#306eaa;font-weight:800;background:transparent;padding:0;border-bottom:3px solid #306eaa;padding-bottom:2px;\">幸运</strong>城市，虽然已经离开挺久的了，但有些故事，依旧想念。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Shanghai-Vertical-Marathon-clean_files/img-002.webp",
      "caption": "魔都 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "上海故事照片 2"
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "title": "流浪上海滩"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">因为美国签证一直下不来，<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"color\" data-cn-tone=\"3\" style=\"color:#9a681c;font-weight:800;background:transparent;padding:0;\">陈老师推荐我去同济庄老师组“交流”</strong>，说是“交流”，其实更多的是忐忑，中美局势紧张，有点看不清楚未来。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong data-cn-emphasis=\"bold\" data-cn-tone=\"0\" style=\"color:#ac4336;font-weight:800;background:transparent;padding:0;\">上海给我的第一感觉并不友好</strong>，出租车司机一副上海小男人的嘴脸，冷嘲热讽外地人的语气让人分分钟想使用武力；旅社隔壁租客胖大姐霸占洗衣机嚣张气焰咄咄逼人，和她大吵一架后直接互相看不顺眼。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">唯一让我感觉有点安慰的是同济的食堂确实还挺好吃的。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Shanghai-Vertical-Marathon-clean_files/img-003.webp",
      "caption": "同济食堂盖面 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "上海故事照片 3"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">国庆之后，上海的秋天来了，距离<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"1\" style=\"color:#237953;font-weight:800;background:transparent;padding:0;border-bottom:3px solid #237953;padding-bottom:2px;\">第一次</strong>面签已经过去了半年，有同样经历的小伙伴也变得焦虑起来。摸摸自己逐渐变胖的肚子，发现又没有形象了。没事也会调侃自己，又胖又没有前途，简直咸鱼。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Shanghai-Vertical-Marathon-clean_files/img-004.webp",
      "caption": "同济食堂盖饭 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "上海故事照片 4"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">所以偶尔也会叹气，不过马上又会告诉自己，顺逆终有时，充实起来，<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"color\" data-cn-tone=\"2\" style=\"color:#306eaa;font-weight:800;background:transparent;padding:0;\">会有硬币的另一面</strong>。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">学习新知识，然后动起来。同济和复旦的操场留下了我的身影，<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"3\" style=\"color:#9a681c;font-weight:800;background:transparent;padding:0;border-bottom:3px solid #9a681c;padding-bottom:2px;\">我也成了同济健身房的常客</strong>，但始终觉得并不够劲。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Shanghai-Vertical-Marathon-clean_files/img-005.webp",
      "caption": "同济操场 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "上海故事照片 5"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Shanghai-Vertical-Marathon-clean_files/img-006.webp",
      "caption": "复旦操场 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "上海故事照片 6"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">这时候AR（addidas runner）出现了，早有耳闻的addidas跑团，我骑着单车慕名去参加，<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"0\" style=\"color:#ac4336;font-weight:800;background:transparent;padding:0;border-bottom:3px solid #ac4336;padding-bottom:2px;\">第一次</strong>跟着跑了十公里，我就被拉爆了，虽然已经是最慢的组了。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Shanghai-Vertical-Marathon-clean_files/img-007.webp",
      "caption": "和AR一起跑外滩 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "上海故事照片 7"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Shanghai-Vertical-Marathon-clean_files/img-008.webp",
      "caption": "和AR一起跑外滩 · 2 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "上海故事照片 8"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Shanghai-Vertical-Marathon-clean_files/img-009.webp",
      "caption": "和AR一起跑外滩 by AR",
      "alt": "和AR一起跑外滩 by AR"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">我就不信了，毕竟自己也大神过，慢慢的我发现能跟上了AR的4：30组完成<span data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"1\" style=\"color:#237953;font-weight:800;background:transparent;padding:0;border-bottom:3px solid #237953;padding-bottom:2px;\">10公里</span>了，也慢慢瘦了一些。</p>"
    },
    {
