      "alt": "上海故事照片 13"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">上海外滩，西岸，世纪公园，这些上海的跑步圣地我都有跟着AR参与过，表白AR。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Shanghai-Vertical-Marathon-clean_files/img-014.webp",
      "caption": "网红西岸 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "上海故事照片 14"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Shanghai-Vertical-Marathon-clean_files/img-015.webp",
      "caption": "AR的特别补给和冰姐照片 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "上海故事照片 15"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">有了组织，我也慢慢融入同济生活，淇民带我到处浪，彬拉着我去虹口看申花，和学弟一起搞科研，跟着闽金泡图书馆，还有幸听了金老师组织的法国大佬公开课，忙起来似乎一切都在变好。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Shanghai-Vertical-Marathon-clean_files/img-016.webp",
      "caption": "带我各种吃的淇民 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "上海故事照片 16"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Shanghai-Vertical-Marathon-clean_files/img-017.webp",
      "caption": "和彬虹口看申花 by 路人",
      "alt": "和彬虹口看申花 by 路人"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Shanghai-Vertical-Marathon-clean_files/img-018.webp",
      "caption": "和学弟搞科研 by 路人",
      "alt": "和学弟搞科研 by 路人"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">十月底我在上海预约了第二次面签，撤掉了北京的申请，过程很smooth，美国白人大叔很客气，可能马上就是万圣节，大使馆里氛围很轻松。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Shanghai-Vertical-Marathon-clean_files/img-019.webp",
      "caption": "万圣节 by 路人",
      "alt": "万圣节 by 路人"
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "title": "登顶上海中心"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">接下来的事情似乎变得积极起来，面签后的一个月，通常会比较开心，有缘和武大老铁去静安寺拜佛求issue，去西湖见了好友还偶遇了大佬施一公，在湄南河边和四面佛前留下了2019年最重要的愿望，也去了趟宁波和那个女孩说再见，简直成了海螺人。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Shanghai-Vertical-Marathon-clean_files/img-020.webp",
      "caption": "静安寺 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "上海故事照片 20"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Shanghai-Vertical-Marathon-clean_files/img-021.webp",
      "caption": "静安寺 · 2 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "上海故事照片 21"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Shanghai-Vertical-Marathon-clean_files/img-022.webp",
      "caption": "静安寺 · 3 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "上海故事照片 22"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">我还报名了上海中心的垂直马拉松。爬楼居然也可以称为马拉松，很新奇所以也想经历，特别在上海机会难得，自然不要错过。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Shanghai-Vertical-Marathon-clean_files/img-023.webp",
      "caption": "魔都夜景 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "上海故事照片 23"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Shanghai-Vertical-Marathon-clean_files/img-024.webp",
      "caption": "魔都夜景 · 2 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "上海故事照片 24"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Shanghai-Vertical-Marathon-clean_files/img-025.webp",
      "caption": "魔都夜景 · 3 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "上海故事照片 25"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">上海中心大厦 Shanghai Tower，127层，建筑主体118层，3398个台阶，垂直高度632m，这是上海最高的摩天大楼。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Shanghai-Vertical-Marathon-clean_files/img-026.webp",
      "caption": "右一上海中心 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "上海故事照片 26"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">2008-2016，总高632米的上海中心在浦江之畔一路疯长，一天一天地从打蛋器进化为今天的魔都新地标，成为上海夜空中一株不灭的火树银花。无论白天还是夜晚，总有人为TA 停留，这也是世界最高的垂直马拉松了。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Shanghai-Vertical-Marathon-clean_files/img-027.webp",
      "caption": "上海中心起跑点 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "上海故事照片 27"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Shanghai-Vertical-Marathon-clean_files/img-028.webp",
      "caption": "起跑 （白胖子）by 摄影师 · 资料图",
      "alt": "上海故事照片 28"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Shanghai-Vertical-Marathon-clean_files/img-029.webp",
      "caption": "进楼 by 摄影师 · 资料图",
      "alt": "上海故事照片 29"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">领物这天我迷醉于上海的夜景，反倒第二天起跑，我倒紧张起来，虽然路跑身经百战，但垂马确是实打实的<span data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"2\" style=\"color:#306eaa;font-weight:800;background:transparent;padding:0;border-bottom:3px solid #306eaa;padding-bottom:2px;\">第一次</span>，每个人都是分时起跑，我比较担心的是楼梯内闷热的空气，不过跑起来才知道，原来上海中心的排风，通风系统真的很赞，有些楼层，甚至还让人感到丝丝凉意。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Shanghai-Vertical-Marathon-clean_files/img-030.webp",
      "caption": "爬楼 by 摄影师 · 资料图",
      "alt": "上海故事照片 30"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Shanghai-Vertical-Marathon-clean_files/img-031.webp",
      "caption": "爬楼 by 摄影师 · 2 · 资料图",
      "alt": "上海故事照片 31"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Shanghai-Vertical-Marathon-clean_files/img-032.webp",
      "caption": "爬楼 by 摄影师 · 3 · 资料图",
      "alt": "上海故事照片 32"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">垂马其实不用跑，大步爬楼就行，总觉得跑起来反而更容易受伤，过程中前面的选手也会礼让后来者，很和谐。部分楼层的补给和避难层也让大家不会有过分的担心，只管安心参与比赛就好。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Shanghai-Vertical-Marathon-clean_files/img-033.webp",
